      slug: "pci-dss-retail-network-security",
      excerpt: "After a retail client failed PCI DSS audit, we rebuilt their network in 45 days. Here's the exact architecture that got them certified.",
      excerptZh: "在一家零售客户PCI DSS审计失败后，我们在45天内重建了他们的网络。以下就是让他们获得认证的确切架构。",
      coverImage: "https://picsum.photos/seed/pci-dss-retail-network-security/800/450",
