        {_type: 'block', children: [{_type: 'span', text: "Q: Who should be involved in preparation?\nA: IT, security, legal, HR, and management. It's a company-wide effort."}]},
        {_type: 'block', children: [{_type: 'span', text: "Q: What if we find problems during preparation?\nA: Fix what you can, document the rest. Auditors respect honesty over perfection."}]}
